      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Sushi is popular all over the world. It has a history of at least 1,800 years."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The earliest form of sushi appeared in China in 200 A.D. At that time, sushi was a way of "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "preserving",
            "ref": "v-preserve"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " food. Fish was placed in rice to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "ferment",
            "zh": "发酵"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". In this way, people could preserve the fish for some time. The rice was thrown away and the fish was eaten when it was wanted."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "By the 7th century, this method of preserving food had "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "spread",
            "ref": "v-spread"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to Japan. The Japanese began to eat the rice with the fish. In the early 19th century, "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Hanaya Yohei",
            "zh": "华屋与兵卫"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " placed a piece of fresh fish on top of an "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "oblong",
            "ref": "v-oblong"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "-shaped piece of seasoned rice. That is now the common way of eating Japanese sushi."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Sushi is still changing. People create new styles of sushi every year. The history of sushi is "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "far from",
            "ref": "v-far-from"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " over."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
